<#-- The body of a storeless sales order's confirmation (mantle.order.SalesOrderServices build#OrderConfirmationMessage; impl-sales P11):
     the order, its seller and customer, the customer's reference, when it was placed and its total. The confirmation as placed is
     attached (Customer Service's stored PDF). impl-sales P17: orderUrl, the recipient's own link to the order's PASS Sales page
     (empty with no published Sales site). -->
<div style="font:11pt Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif">
<p>${customerName},</p>
<p>${sellerName} confirms your order ${orderId}<#if reference> (your reference ${reference})</#if>, placed ${placedText}, for ${totalText}.
The confirmation is attached.</p>
<#if orderUrl><p>Follow its delivery and invoices online: <a href="${orderUrl}">${orderUrl}</a></p></#if>
</div>
